{"id":"ahm9h0ze17d59w68b3ia8ue15","title":"三季度公募基金规模排名变化：南方基金逆势增长615亿，易方达仍居榜首","originalTitle":"基金三季度规模“座次”揭晓：“调整季”里“攻守易形”（附全部排名）","summary":"三季度公募基金非货规模前十名：易方达16921.82亿、华夏11932.53亿、广发10043.58亿、富国9938.04亿、南方基金8420.26亿（+615亿）、汇添富等。次头部阵营中，海富通单季增198亿，贝莱德基金规模跃升31位至第91名，中银国际证券规模骤降43位至第101名。前50名门槛扩大至136.6亿，腰部阵营竞争加剧。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"华尔街见闻"},"links":{"original":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784675"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-28T09:38:45.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-28T10:03:26.405Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-28T10:03:26.405Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["行情异动","研究报告"],"score":86,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}